OL,3,GNEWSADrugs cash used to fund raids on
OL,4,Asuspected dealers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police boss funding a series of raids
OL,7,Fagainst suspected drug dealers said the
OL,8,Fmoney came from half a million pounds
OL,9,Ffound under another dealer's bed.
OL,11,FCumbria Police said search warrants
OL,12,Fwere executed across the county on
OL,13,FWednesday as part of a "day of action"
OL,14,Fintended to disrupt serious and
OL,15,Forganised crime.
OL,17,FDuring raids in Penrith, Barrow and
OL,18,FKendal, a total of four men were
OL,19,Farrested and #30,000 of drugs seized.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
