OL,5,
OL,6,FCumbria's police, fire and crime
OL,7,Fcommissioner (PFCC) David Allen said on
OL,8,Fa similar day of action last year, "we
OL,9,Ffound half a million pounds under one
OL,10,Fdrug dealer's bed".
